# The Prophet — VoiceForge

SwiftUI macOS voice cloning app using mlx-speech.

- `mlx-speech` must be in PATH before running
- WAV output — don't change audio format
- SwiftUI only, no AppKit
- Build: `swift build` / `swift test`
